<title>AUSTRALIA: Portman says coal mine output may double.</title>
<headline>Portman says coal mine output may double.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portman Mining Ltd said on Wednesday it will complete a study next month on a possible expansion of its Burton coal mine in Queensland state.</p>
<p>The expansion would double production of hard coking and thermal coals from the current annual rate of two million tonnes, the company said.</p>
<p>Burton began production last November.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
